    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερᾰτουργ-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>working of wonders</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.42
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περὶ γαστέρα τ</span>. its
				<i>wonderful working</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.60
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>use</i> or <i>love of the marvellous</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐν τοῖς λόγοις τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Icar.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.17b
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
